<title>USA: Med/Waste to buy Bonham Environmental.</title>
<headline>Med/Waste to buy Bonham Environmental.</headline>
<dateline>OPA LOCKA, Fla. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Med/Waste Inc said Friday it has signed a defintive agreement to buy Bonham Environmental Services Inc, a privately-owned holding company based in Cincinnati, Ohio, which provides medical waste services.</p>
<p>Med/Waste, which is in the same line of business, said closing of the deal is subject to normal conditions, including due diligence and receipt of audited financial statements.</p>
<p>Med/Waste did not disclose the purchase price.</p>
</text>
